# No automatic release

Agents must not ship Excubia App to `main` without an explicit user request. `develop` is the integration branch. `main` is for releases.

## Allowed

- Open a `develop` → `main` release pull request when the user asks for a release
- Stop after that pull request is open

## Forbidden unless the user explicitly asks

- Merge a release pull request (`develop` → `main`)
- Bump versions or create git tags (`vX.Y.Z` or otherwise)
- Run `gh release create` or publish a GitHub Release
- Push to `main` to cut a release
- Publish Docker or GHCR images
